# Theme gallery
{.lead} One neutral body, re-rendered across all eleven themes to show the accent in its meaning-spots. Its own theme is plum.

```mdp:flow
Pick a theme -> Compile -> Compare the accent
```

```mdp:stats
Themes: 11
Accent spots: links, figures, dots
Ink ramp: one, shared
```

> "A theme is a designed system you select, not styles you set."
> {.cite} The vision

:::callout note
The accent appears only in meaning-spots (links, the compare button, stat figures, the active dot, flow arrows), never to color a whole surface.
:::
